{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231150","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1023115001:1":{"text":"つきましたよ！<hpy>ロリエットさ……！</hpy>","source_cn":"我们到了！<hpy>罗丽叶小——！</hpy>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2013EE89DC97F298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023115002:1":{"text":"しーっ！静かに！ここは夜風に伝言を頼みましょう。","source_cn":"嘘！别声张！让晚风给罗丽叶捎个口信吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82C7203629EA6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1023115002":{"text":"しーっ！静かに！ここは夜風に伝言を頼みましょう。","source_cn":"嘘！别声张！让晚风给罗丽叶捎个口信吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE82C7203629EA6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023115003:2":{"text":"「清涼な風よ、彼女に伝えておくれ、僕がどんなに会いたがっているか。<hpy>清流を失った遊魚は、抑えきれぬ悲しみの淵を彷徨っている。</hpy>","source_cn":"“给我一阵清风替我告诉她——我多想念她，<hpy>宛如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB838B087EFF51D2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1023115004:1":{"text":"清涼な風よ、彼女に伝えておくれ、僕がどんなに愛しているか。<hpy>心に刻むは彼女の名前、本能が囁くは彼女への情愛。</hpy>","source_cn":"给我一阵清风替我告诉她——我多爱慕她，<hpy>她姓名...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C491DC9694DD679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1023115005:1":{"text":"どんなに平凡な日々も、彼女がいれば、すべてが奇跡へと変わる。","source_cn":"若与她同在，再平凡的日常，也会化作连绵不绝的奇迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF5C2207E376247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1023115006:1":{"text":"どんなに美しい景色も、彼女がいなければ、すべてが光を失う。","source_cn":"若无她相伴，再美的风景，也变得黯然无光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9DF44EB0F151ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1023115007:1":{"text":"愛を誓い合ったエクラ湖のほとりで、君に思いを馳せながら、幾度も巡る。","source_cn":"我在初定情缘的映湖旁徘徊，反反复复，流连忘返。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860FD0C76657C9EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1023115008:1":{"text":"彼女との隔たりは、星すらも曇らせる……","source_cn":"与她相隔时，星光也不再闪烁……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22F987ECC1638D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1023115009:0":{"text":"<hpy>なぜなら、彼女よりも眩い星など存在しないから、彼女がいるだけで、すべては奇跡と化すのだから……」</hpy>","source_cn":"<hpy>因为世上未曾有比她更璀璨的星星。一切与她相关...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF450325AA949BB9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1023115010:1":{"text":"……いいじゃないか。本当にラブレターを書くのは初めてか？","source_cn":"……<hpy>写得不错啊，你真的是第一次写情书？</hpy>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FFA1AB2D3A6E11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1023115011:1":{"text":"これが才能というものです！","source_cn":"这就是天赋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1011032388F74AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1023115011":{"text":"これが才能というものです！","source_cn":"这就是天赋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1011032388F74AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1023115012:1":{"text":"大丈夫です、彼女が来ましたよ……","source_cn":"别着急，她来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF653E58E618B5742","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"どうやってこの手紙をロリエットに渡そうか？","source_cn":"怎么把这封信交给罗丽叶呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x88A3C0B7747F717A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"どうやってこの手紙をロリエットに渡そうか？","female":"どうやってこの手紙をロリエットに渡しましょうか？","variant_male_record_index":"59078","variant_female_record_index":"59079","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"夜風？","so